        "original_id": "f236a33c-c3eb-5ebf-8347-aa8753f7d987",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: FC Barcelona, AC Milan, UEFA Champions League\n- People: Daniele Massaro, Dejan Savićević, Marcel Desailly\n- Events: 1993–94 FC Barcelona season, UEFA Champions League final\n- Topics: football, domestic league success\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1993–94 season, FC Barcelona retained domestic league supremacy and reached the UEFA Champions League final.\n- In the 1993–94 UEFA Champions League final, FC Barcelona lost 0–4 to AC Milan.\n- In that final, AC Milan's goals were scored by Daniele Massaro, Dejan Savićević, and Marcel Desailly.\n- Daniele Emilio Massaro was born on 23 May 1961.\n- Daniele Massaro is an Italian former footballer who played as a forward.",
